        "status": "draft",
        "text": "The front matter of the report of the 8th National Tuberculosis Programme Managers Meeting and 13th Wolfheze Workshop, held in The Hague in June 2008 and organized by WHO Europe, KNCV and ECDC. It includes an abstract on drug-resistant TB and TB/HIV in the WHO European Region and the eighteen high-priority countries, keywords and a table of contents listing sessions and annexes. The abstract notes the meeting's focus on management, surveillance and evaluation of TB control.",
